WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
Do you like cinnamon rolls?

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.873
In the past, cinnamon was considered a spice

00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:08.408
for the wealthy in Taiwan

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.211
meaning it was something only the nobility could afford

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.880
How expensive is it?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.748
More expensive than gold

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:15.849
I once ate at a Vietnamese restaurant

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.885
in the United States

00:00:17.885 --> 00:00:21.221
Seeing those thick and long cinnamon sticks

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:23.757
at the entrance of his restaurant

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.792
The price came to mind as soon as I saw it.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.628
It probably scared me to death.

00:00:27.628 --> 00:00:30.130
Xiaofen (transliteration), guess how much one costs?

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.367
I'm guessing it's five thousand NT dollars?

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:34.034
I tell you

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.669
You really underestimated it.

00:00:35.669 --> 00:00:36.637
Did you know?

00:00:36.637 --> 00:00:39.673
If it were a piece of cinnamon as thick as the kind

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:41.842
you see in Taiwan

00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:43.844
it would cost well over a hundred thousand New Taiwan dollars

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:46.680
Wow, that cinnamon is inlaid with gold!

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.282
Now we don't have to spend a lot of money

00:00:48.282 --> 00:00:49.483
to eat cinnamon

00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:51.351
They would then be able to enjoy the same treatment

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:55.155
as the wealthy aristocrats of yesteryear

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.157
How to eat cinnamon

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.192
to stabilize blood sugar

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.827
I'll tell you right away

00:01:02.129 --> 00:01:03.430
Hu Naiwen is about to begin his lecture.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.766
I am your old friend, Dr. Hu.

00:01:05.766 --> 00:01:07.868
Drink it together with coffee

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.437
to warm the body and help stabilize blood sugar

00:01:11.505 --> 00:01:12.639
Swedes and Friends

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.608
What do you eat at parties?

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:15.642
Clang clang clang clang

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.045
Cinnamon rolls with coffee

00:01:18.045 --> 00:01:19.980
It looks delicious, doesn't it?

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.715
Taiwan in the last three or four years

00:01:21.715 --> 00:01:26.086
This also sparked a cinnamon craze.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:30.057
From coffee and cappuccino to desserts

00:01:30.057 --> 00:01:31.959
Cinnamon even made it

00:01:31.959 --> 00:01:34.695
onto the trending topics list online

00:01:34.695 --> 00:01:36.396
Wow, seeing coffee

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.231
with cinnamon&nbsp;as a combination

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.733
I just thought that cappuccinos

00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:41.501
also add cinnamon powder

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.669
Right

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.605
What are the benefits of adding cinnamon to coffee?

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.439
Did you know

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:46.807
Attention, people with diabetes!

00:01:46.807 --> 00:01:49.242
It has a pretty good effect on blood sugar control

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.177
There is a Japanese

00:01:50.177 --> 00:01:53.113
Diabetes specialist Makita Zenji

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.615
He has a 43-year-old patient

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.351
don't want to rely on taking medicine

00:01:57.351 --> 00:01:58.518
The doctor prescribed

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.987
that he add about 3 grams of cinnamon powder

00:01:59.987 --> 00:02:02.422
to his coffee every day

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:05.492
Simultaneously control carbohydrates

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.426
4 months later

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.228
Do you know what happened

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:09.896
The patient's glycated hemoglobin level

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:12.833
decreased from 9.9 to 5.6

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:14.668
It's back to normal

00:02:14.668 --> 00:02:16.670
because cinnamon contains cinnamaldehyde

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:20.507
which can enhance insulin sensitivity

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:23.276
Helps stabilize blood sugar

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:26.113
Cinnamon can stabilize blood sugar and warm the body.

00:02:26.113 --> 00:02:28.548
Sometimes when we are very cold

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.751
After drinking hot coffee

00:02:30.751 --> 00:02:33.787
But it will be very cold after drinking it, right?

00:02:33.787 --> 00:02:35.422
You can sprinkle a little cinnamon powder

00:02:35.422 --> 00:02:37.491
on it when you drink coffee

00:02:37.491 --> 00:02:39.226
this&nbsp;Cinnamaldehyde

00:02:39.226 --> 00:02:41.094
This can help the body generate heat

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.063
Promotes blood circulation

00:02:43.063 --> 00:02:45.432
Suitable for people with cold hands and feet

00:02:45.432 --> 00:02:46.900
Since cinnamon powder is so good

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:48.769
Then I'll drink two cups of coffee every day.

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:51.238
Sprinkle the cinnamon powder evenly over the entire container

00:02:51.238 --> 00:02:52.606
Hehehe

00:02:52.606 --> 00:02:53.440
Remind you

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.209
Cinnamon powder doesn't mean the more you eat, the better it is for your health.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:58.011
How much cinnamon can eat in a day

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.146
If want to eat a little bit every day

00:02:59.146 --> 00:03:00.113
To control

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:02.716
Within half a teaspoon to one teaspoon

00:03:02.716 --> 00:03:05.419
Just half a teaspoon, that's all.

00:03:05.419 --> 00:03:07.254
Within half a teaspoon to one teaspoon

00:03:07.254 --> 00:03:08.422
Cold hands and feet

00:03:08.422 --> 00:03:11.158
joints hurt whenever the weather changes.

00:03:11.158 --> 00:03:13.427
A cup of tea dispels&nbsp;hán shī (transliteration)

00:03:13.427 --> 00:03:15.529
People say that Chūn tiān hòu mǔ xīn (transliteration)

00:03:15.529 --> 00:03:17.297
The speed at which change attitude is even faster

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:19.766
than flipping through a book

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:22.102
It's as warm as summer during the day.

00:03:22.102 --> 00:03:24.004
It was as cold as winter in the evening.

00:03:24.004 --> 00:03:25.272
Do your hands and feet get cold

00:03:25.272 --> 00:03:26.940
when the weather changes?

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.675
knees started to ache

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:31.511
Hmm, were you nodding silently over there?

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.980
Okay, come and have a cup

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.449
of hot cinnamon ginger tea

00:03:35.449 --> 00:03:37.184
How to drink cinnamon ginger tea

00:03:37.184 --> 00:03:41.388
You can use a thermos or a thermal food jar to steep it.

00:03:41.388 --> 00:03:43.890
Prepare a small piece of ginger

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.559
3 red dates

00:03:45.559 --> 00:03:48.028
1/3 teaspoon of cinnamon powder

00:03:48.028 --> 00:03:49.963
Brown sugar (appropriate amount)

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:50.731
preparation

00:03:50.731 --> 00:03:52.833
Make two cuts on the red dates

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:54.501
Slice the ginger

00:03:54.501 --> 00:03:56.103
Add 3 slices of ginger

00:03:56.103 --> 00:03:58.505
Put the red dates in a thermos.

00:03:58.505 --> 00:04:00.841
Soak in 500cc of hot water

00:04:00.841 --> 00:04:03.043
Simmer it for 10 to 15 minutes

00:04:03.043 --> 00:04:05.078
Finally, add a pinch of cinnamon powder.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:06.746
Appropriate amount of brown sugar

00:04:06.747 --> 00:04:08.782
It's ready to drink

00:04:08.782 --> 00:04:11.084
after stirring gently

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:12.953
Remember to add the cinnamon powder last

00:04:12.953 --> 00:04:15.188
Because its aroma is the most pronounced

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:17.023
It doesn't taste bitter.

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:18.425
Look

00:04:18.425 --> 00:04:20.961
These are good quality cinnamon slices bought

00:04:20.961 --> 00:04:23.096
from a traditional Chinese medicine store

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:25.232
Cinnamon

00:04:25.232 --> 00:04:26.299
is not just a simple seasoning

00:04:26.299 --> 00:04:28.335
Traditional Chinese medicine considers cinnamon to be a

00:04:28.335 --> 00:04:29.402
pure yang medicine

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:31.104
Néng bǔ mìng mén zhī huǒ (transliteration)

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:32.072
What is the "Mìng mén"(transliteration)?

00:04:32.072 --> 00:04:34.775
It's like the power supply

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.042
