00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.611
As long as the huǒ (transliteration) isn't enough

00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:39.045
Your body may experience cold hands and feet

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:42.015
and weakness in the lower back and knees

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:45.252
Poor digestion makes people tired easily

00:04:45.252 --> 00:04:48.388
feet are so cold when try to sleep that can't fall asleep.

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:49.289
These are all related to insufficient

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:51.892
mìng mén huǒ(transliteration)

00:04:51.892 --> 00:04:54.161
Cinnamon is like a spark

00:04:54.161 --> 00:04:55.595
that warms the kidneys

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:58.498
It dispelled the&nbsp;hán qì(transliteration)&nbsp;from my body.

00:04:58.498 --> 00:05:02.836
Strengthening the waist and improving blood circulation helps the Qi flow more smoothly.

00:05:02.836 --> 00:05:06.106
Ginger can also warm the stomach and lungs.

00:05:06.106 --> 00:05:08.208
experience menstrual cramps during period.

00:05:08.208 --> 00:05:10.010
Ladies who often eat ice cream

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.044
can eat it now

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:12.479
I didn't like cinnamon before.

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:14.748
Now I know how powerful cinnamon is.

00:05:14.748 --> 00:05:15.615
More than just impressive

00:05:15.615 --> 00:05:17.184
It's incredibly powerful.

00:05:17.184 --> 00:05:19.219
The most potent part of cinnamon is called

00:05:19.219 --> 00:05:20.587
Yǐn huǒ guī yuán (transliteration)

00:05:20.587 --> 00:05:21.588
What does that mean?

00:05:21.588 --> 00:05:24.758
It's about all that&nbsp;huǒ&nbsp;(transliteration)&nbsp;running rampant inside your body.

00:05:24.758 --> 00:05:26.426
Collect them all

00:05:26.426 --> 00:05:28.628
Return to the kidney

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:30.263
replenish your body

00:05:30.263 --> 00:05:32.666
The truly needed zhèng huǒ (transliteration)

00:05:32.666 --> 00:05:34.467
When the kidneys have sufficient energy

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.536
Your hands and feet will feel warm.

00:05:36.536 --> 00:05:38.271
mental state has also improved

00:05:38.271 --> 00:05:41.241
Like those aunties and older women who work outdoors

00:05:41.241 --> 00:05:42.475
When it rains

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:45.045
Joints are prone to soreness and stiffness

00:05:45.045 --> 00:05:46.413
Have a drink at this time

00:05:46.413 --> 00:05:48.915
Hot cinnamon ginger tea

00:05:48.915 --> 00:05:50.050
It's really great

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.952
Help warm your hands and feet

00:05:51.952 --> 00:05:55.522
It also helps to get rid of the hán shī (transliteration) in your joints.

00:05:55.522 --> 00:05:57.090
A sour and tingly feeling

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.626
It will be much more comfortable then.

00:05:59.626 --> 00:06:01.127
Cinnamon is very good for women

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:04.331
It's also great for men to eat.

00:06:04.331 --> 00:06:06.199
A famous prescription in traditional Chinese medicine

00:06:06.199 --> 00:06:08.435
It's called&nbsp; wǔ líng sàn(transliteration), and it contains cinnamon.

00:06:08.435 --> 00:06:10.837
Can treat urinary retention

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.339
Helps with smooth urination

00:06:12.339 --> 00:06:13.940
Also, bā wèi dì huáng wán (transliteration)

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.977
Cinnamon is also used to yǐn huǒ guī yuán (transliteration)

00:06:16.977 --> 00:06:19.212
Which country has the best cinnamon?

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:21.615
Adding these 3 ingredients makes it the most nourishing

00:06:21.615 --> 00:06:23.316
Cinnamon lovers

