00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:39.966
Vietnam

00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:42.102
There is a place in Vietnam called Thanh Hóa

00:06:42.102 --> 00:06:44.437
It produces the best cinnamon.

00:06:44.437 --> 00:06:47.774
More fragrant, richer, and spicier

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:49.542
The cinnamon that grows there

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:50.543
