00:06:52.479 --> 00:06:53.813
qīng huá guì (transliteration)

00:06:53.813 --> 00:06:54.881
What country's cinnamon

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:56.082
is used in the cinnamon rolls we eat

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.851
