00:06:57.851 --> 00:06:59.552
Cinnamon rolls typically use

00:06:59.552 --> 00:07:02.355
Cinnamon from Vietnam or Taiwan

00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:03.890
What about cinnamon used in traditional Chinese medicine?

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.258
