00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:06.926
Most of the cinnamon

00:07:06.927 --> 00:07:08.595
comes from guì zhōu (transliteration)

00:07:08.595 --> 00:07:10.163
Běn cǎo bèi yào (transliteration) records

00:07:10.163 --> 00:07:12.632
Chū lǐng nán guì zhōu zhě liáng&nbsp;(transliteration)

