00:07:13.967 --> 00:07:15.435
Lǐng nán (transliteration) region

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.470
High-quality cinnamon produced

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.838
The name Guì zhōu (transliteration)

00:07:18.838 --> 00:07:20.340
It's because of cinnamon

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.542
It got its name because of the word “gui” (transliteration)

00:07:22.542 --> 00:07:24.344
Are there good and bad types of cinnamon?

00:07:24.344 --> 00:07:24.844
have

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:27.681
You see, the kind with thicker flesh...

00:07:27.681 --> 00:07:29.983
Dark brown with a purplish tinge

00:07:29.983 --> 00:07:32.585
That cinnamon is of good quality.

00:07:32.585 --> 00:07:35.455
There is a book called běn cǎo cuō yào (transliteration)

00:07:35.455 --> 00:07:36.890
Records indicate that cinnamon pairs best with

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.193
