00:07:40.193 --> 00:07:41.695
It can replenish the middle qi.

00:07:41.695 --> 00:07:44.898
Enhance the overall tonic effect

00:07:44.898 --> 00:07:46.333
tell you a secret

00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:48.968
Besides buying cinnamon, you'll use it in your cooking.

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:52.105
Sichuan peppercorns, spice packet, black and white pepper powder

00:07:52.105 --> 00:07:54.007
Go to the pharmacy to buy

00:07:54.007 --> 00:07:56.109
The quality is excellent.

00:07:56.109 --> 00:07:59.279
Eating these 3 foods

00:07:59.279 --> 00:08:01.614
with cinnamon may cause dry mouth and constipation

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:03.917
What should you not eat with cinnamon?

00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:05.218
These three foods

00:08:05.218 --> 00:08:08.488
Foods that are too Hán xìng(transliteration), too hot, or too oily

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:09.389
Let's talk about the first type first.

00:08:09.389 --> 00:08:10.857
Eat Hán xìng(transliteration) foods together

00:08:10.857 --> 00:08:13.360
Like mung beans, winter melon, watermelon

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.729
These foods are eaten with cinnamon

00:08:15.729 --> 00:08:18.365
It will negate the effects of warming and nourishing.

00:08:18.365 --> 00:08:20.800
Originally intended to replenish the body

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.803
It turned out that none of them worked anymore.

00:08:23.803 --> 00:08:25.538
The second option is to not pair them.

00:08:25.538 --> 00:08:27.907
Chili peppers, ginger, mutton

00:08:27.907 --> 00:08:29.275
Cinnamon is warming.

00:08:29.275 --> 00:08:32.078
Foods that are considered "rè xìng"(transliteration) in traditional Chinese medicine, such as chili peppers, ginger, and mutton.

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:33.646
Putting them together easily becomes

00:08:33.646 --> 00:08:35.348
Excessive Huǒ qì (transliteration)

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:38.585
Dry mouth and constipation may be the cause.

00:08:38.585 --> 00:08:41.054
Is it okay to eat

00:08:41.054 --> 00:08:41.955
