00:08:41.955 --> 00:08:44.824
Haha, it doesn't work either.

00:08:44.824 --> 00:08:47.460
You think of cinnamon as a heater.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.195
Huǒ wǎng lǐ miàn shōu&nbsp;(transliteration)

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:51.097
Warmth is felt in the five internal organs.

00:08:51.097 --> 00:08:52.198
raw scallions

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:54.300
It's for ventilation by opening windows.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.536
That is to say, when it's cold

00:08:56.536 --> 00:08:58.038
You even opened the window

00:08:58.038 --> 00:09:00.006
It opens up your pores as soon as you eat it.

00:09:00.006 --> 00:09:02.709
Makes you sweat

00:09:02.709 --> 00:09:04.377
One is pulling inwards

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.645
One scattered outwards

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:07.547
Completely opposite directions

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:10.183
The effects cancel each other out

00:09:10.183 --> 00:09:12.485
The third point is that cinnamon

00:09:12.485 --> 00:09:16.389
should not be eaten with fatty meat, fried chicken, or barbecue

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:19.225
Cinnamon is actually used to boost energy.

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:20.593
But greasy food

00:09:20.593 --> 00:09:22.328
is blocking that airway

00:09:22.328 --> 00:09:24.864
Your stomach and intestines will easily feel very stuffy

00:09:24.864 --> 00:09:26.766
And indigestion

00:09:26.766 --> 00:09:28.435
Just a reminder that cinnamon is edible.

00:09:28.435 --> 00:09:31.504
But still, don’t eat the cinnamon bark

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:32.872
It is poisonous.

00:09:32.872 --> 00:09:35.008
One type of person is prone to bleeding when eating cinnamon.

00:09:35.008 --> 00:09:36.976
3 types of people should not eat

00:09:36.976 --> 00:09:39.345
So, who shouldn't eat cinnamon powder?

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:40.113
I know

