00:09:49.756 --> 00:09:51.491
I was just kidding!

00:09:51.491 --> 00:09:52.292
I know

00:09:52.292 --> 00:09:54.160
Pregnant women should not eat this

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.563
That's right. Besides pregnant women,

00:09:56.563 --> 00:09:57.897
people prone to bleeding or with a rè xìng (transliteration) constitution

00:09:57.897 --> 00:10:00.633
should also avoid eating it.

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:02.035
Let's start with pregnant women.

00:10:02.035 --> 00:10:04.571
1. Why can't pregnant women eat cinnamon?

00:10:04.571 --> 00:10:06.439
Cinnamon promotes blood circulation

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:09.442
Excessive intake may trigger uterine contractions.

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:13.146
